 <strong>C32</strong></p><p>Air Bag wiring\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C50</strong></p><p>ABS wiring \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C12</strong></p>"],[576,15,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>front wiring \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C41</strong></p>"],[2047,15,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>engine wiring \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C40</strong></p>"],[2047,15,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>engine wiring \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C40 A</strong></p>"],[16,15,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>coils and injectors wiring\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C40</strong></p>"]]